In the [[The Battle Cats Unite!|Nintendo Switch]] version of [[The Battle Cats]], there is a myriad of content that is exclusive to this version. Features such as Cat Units, Enemies, stages, and more that are not normally found in other versions. 

==Features==

=== Serial Codes ===
Though once available in the mobile versions of The Battle Cats and in [[Minna de Nyanko Daisensou|Minna de Nyanko Dasiensou]], the Switch version is currently the only one that supports this feature as it also provides the majority of exclusives found in-game.

==Cat Units==
There are several units that are only obtainable in this version only, however, most can only be unlocked by purchasing real-life merchandise to play them. All Switch-exclusive cats, except Filibuster Cat α, are the only Special Cats capable of gaining "+" levels.
